Today I am leaving this temporary room.
My new flat is in this very building.
Now I am putting my things in the suitcase.
First, I look at the small cupboard.
What is in the cupboard?
One book is kept in the cupboard.
I put that book in the suitcase.
Now the cupboard is empty.
Then I look at the bed.
Is there anything on the bed?
A small bag is kept on the bed.
My mobile phone is near the bag.
I put this mobile phone in the small bag.
Is there anything under the bed?
There is nothing there.
All my things are now in the large suitcase.
I close the suitcase.
This suitcase is very heavy.
Now everything is ready.
I am going to my new home.
